## Current Behavior

Server uses MySQL at `/home/ritz/programs/mysql-server/` which is:
- Shared across multiple projects
- Not version controlled with this project
- Custom changes lost if reinstalled

## Intended Behavior

MySQL installation local to this project at `mysql/` with:
1. Binaries compiled into `mysql/installed-files/`
2. Database files at `mysql/databases/`
3. Configuration at `mysql/conf/`
4. Database content tracked in git (custom world changes preserved)

## Directory Structure

```
mysql/
├── build/              # CMake build directory (gitignored)
├── source/             # MySQL source code (gitignored)
├── installed-files/
│   ├── bin/            # mysqld, mysql client (gitignored)
│   ├── lib/            # Libraries (gitignored)
│   └── share/          # Data files (gitignored)
├── databases/          # TRACKED - custom world data lives here
│   ├── acore_auth/
│   ├── acore_world/
│   └── acore_characters/
└── conf/
    └── my.cnf          # MySQL configuration
```

