## Notes

Using a different port (3307) allows running alongside system MySQL if needed.

The database tracking approach means:
- `git diff` shows world data changes
- Can revert problematic changes
- History of balance tweaks preserved
- Collaboration on world design possible

Consider: SQL dump files might be more git-friendly than raw InnoDB files.
Could export key tables as .sql and track those instead of binary files.

